Description: CDOS Session Manager - CDOS session
 The CDOS Session Manager is in charge of starting the core components
 of the CDOS desktop, and applications that should be launched at
 login time. It also features a way to save and restore currently
 running applications.
 .
 This package contains the required components for the standard CDOS
 session. It can be started from a display manager such as GDM,
 and requires 3D acceleration to work properly.
